  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "The sources are a season report, a council work session transcript and a survey about Cedar Hollow's winter warming center, a fictional city.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Cedar Hollow Winter Warming Center: Season Report, 2025-26”",
            "source_id": "s_a2aefb7a7340"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_06d9b7f7b275"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P11",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_a51272c9e543"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The center was open 87 nights and recorded 2,914 overnight stays by 412 different guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What the center did”",
            "source_id": "s_a2aefb7a7340"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The season cost $318,400, or $109 per overnight stay, paid by the city, a county grant and donations.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What it cost”",
            "source_id": "s_a2aefb7a7340"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Staff recommend opening earlier, a 35-degree trigger and a second east side site that would add $142,000.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_a2aefb7a7340"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[1:02]",
            "source_id": "s_06d9b7f7b275"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The mayor put the second site and earlier opening on the April 8 budget work session agenda.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P10",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[3:10]",
            "source_id": "s_06d9b7f7b275"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "The hall is set up for 60, but 61 guests came on January 21. Will a 35-degree trigger instead of 32 bring more guests than the hall can hold?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_06d9b7f7b275"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What the center did”",
            "source_id": "s_a2aefb7a7340"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_a2aefb7a7340"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "74 percent of guests said getting to the center was the hardest part. Will one east side site fix that, when doors still open at 7 p.m. and guests asked for 5 p.m.?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P13",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 3,
